- [[g:Virtual Threads]] (final): lightweight thread-per-request concurrency, scales to millions of I/O tasks
- [[g:Pattern matching for switch]] + record deconstruction: very expressive logic
- Sequenced Collections: a unified first/last/reversed API
- Structured concurrency (preview), Scoped Values (preview), Generational ZGC

