:::deep
- pattern matching for switch + record deconstruction → very expressive data handling
- Sequenced Collections unify `getFirst/getLast/reversed`
- Generational ZGC (21) reduces CPU overhead versus non-generational ZGC

**Migrating to virtual threads** — nearly [[g:'drop-in']] for blocking services (Spring Boot 3.2+: `spring.threads.virtual.enabled=true`), but:
- [[r:audit `synchronized`]] on hot paths (pinning)
- you still need to bound downstream resources (VTs don't automatically protect the DB from 10k concurrent queries — you still need a pool/semaphore)
:::
